  "scope": [
    "Whole-fixture elapsed time includes setup, prolonged simulation and waits before or after attempted input; it is not edit latency.",
    "Input-to-admission, worker queue, native owner service, receipt delivery and publication are separately observed nested or overlapping spans. Do not sum them.",
    "Native geometry time combines exact geometry reconstruction and connectivity. This instrumentation does not separately time those two operations.",
    "Native target/mutation/geometry counters exclude facade normalization, projection, marshalling, fingerprint work and some post-debit work. Broader owner-service and end-to-end spans include broader work; they are not interchangeable with core phase counters.",
    "Continued strokes are throttled to about 30 admissions/second. Fresh presses and committed Slice intents bypass that interval; every route still permits only one outstanding transaction.",
    "The creative-construction geometry installation joins the actual final owner and revision to a Main Rapier GeometryInstalled event and the installed body; it is separate from native reconstruction.",
    "Publication means Main observed its authoritative publication installed. It is not physical monitor presentation.",
    "Owned and simultaneously awake bodies are reported separately. Hosted timings do not establish owner Ryzen 5 5600X/TITAN RTX performance."
  ]
